192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In gas phase measurement, the liquid sample is first injected into glass sparger where reagent gets added and then due to exothermic reaction  the entire residual molecule gets converted into gaseous phase which further gets carried to the gas flow cell using ambient air.  Afterward, the sample is introduced into the cell the absorption spectrum is captured using UV spectroscopy and the concentration of the compound is determined through FFT mathematical treatment.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
