201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It is based on a color-developing chemical reaction carried out inside the analyser flow cell.  Sample is injected by the sample pump and mixed with the appropriate reagents to enable a reaction.  The analyser uses Xenon Lamp  and a photodiode to photometrically measure the developed color intensity \(absorbance\).  The absorbance is proportional to the concentration of the sample \(analyte\).)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
